the sprites - animated or not - require a bit of extra information attached to each one
such as number of sprites, if it's a one-shot, etc; hence the need for the separate structure
each sprite will have a pointer to their currently attached texture and changing the sprite
will not happen often (for example, every frame) - unordered_map lookup time is not an issue
